Put one finding back to the tests and say whether it is still there

Usage: mjutest replay [OPTIONS] <FINDING>

Arguments:
  <FINDING>  The finding, by subject or by any prefix that names exactly one

Options:
      --run <RUN>  The run to read the finding from. The latest by default
      --offline    Pass `--offline` to cargo
      --locked     Pass `--locked` to cargo
  -h, --help       Print help
